@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

hide footbox
autonumber

title As a User, I want to publicly share a list of mine

actor User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
activate System

User --> System: I want to publicly share a Collection of Publications

System --> User: Select a collection! (lists)

User --> System: SelectedCollection

System --> User: Your collection is public now!

@enduml